      "value": "@{6142bc91c830f70736b61114|full_name}: \n\nI understand.\n\nPerhaps you could also try to combine the issues mentioned here.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/creator-companion-beta/p/vcc-101bug-legacyfolders-and-legacyfiles-are-not-removed-when-adding-user-packag\n\nAlso, if you are in a hurry, why not raise the ticket over here?\n\nhttps://github.com/vrchat-community/creator-companion/issues",
